                <p>Omit:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>•	Datacasting service providers must hold datacasting licences.</p>
                </content>
