              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>designated </i></b><b><i>datacasting</i></b><b><i> service</i></b> has the meaning given by clause 2A.</p>
                </content>
